      "title": "Qt: Do not display capture start/end times when unset",
      "message": "Qt: Do not display capture start/end times when unset\n\nInstead of being null, cap_start and cap_end can be the special unset\nnstime_t value when they don't exist.\n\nFix a check against DBL_MIN vs DBL_MAX.\n\nMake sure that file_end_ts is initialized to unset in wtap_open_offline.\n\nFixup 3ddff8bd6cdb50cae57b8a9d219a6bdb24e5805b\n",
